  "summary": "World Leaks, an affiliate-based extortion-as-a-service operation rebranded from Hunters International, was observed contradicting its encryption-free model by deploying a ransomware payload that encrypted a healthcare victim's data. The intrusion began with brute force against a Fortigate appliance in October 2025, used PsExec, WinRM and Cloudflare Tunnel for lateral movement and C2, exfiltrated 80+GB to MEGA and Backblaze via rclone, and ended with SMB-delivered world.exe/task.bat and a nine-character-prefixed README ransom note.",
